@startuml "Student Notifications Sequence"
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam sequenceMessageSize 22
actor "Sinh viên" as Student
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "StudentController" as SC
database "CSDL" as DB

Student -> FE: Xem thông báo
FE -> SC: GET /api/student/notifications
SC -> DB: SELECT notifications
DB --> SC: data
SC --> FE: 200 OK

Student -> FE: Xem chi tiết thông báo
FE -> SC: GET /api/student/notifications/{id}
SC -> DB: SELECT notification by id
DB --> SC: data
SC --> FE: 200 OK

Student -> FE: Đánh dấu đã đọc
FE -> SC: PUT /api/student/notifications/{id}/read
SC -> DB: UPDATE notifications (read_at)
DB --> SC: OK
SC --> FE: 200 OK
@enduml
